<title>USA: IPO PRICING-JLK Direct prices top of range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-JLK Direct prices top of range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	  JLK Direct Distribution Inc</p>
